        "system__conversation_history": "{\"x-elevenlabs-history\": true, \"entries\": [{\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Hi, this is Morgan, the AI receptionist for First Property Investment. How can I help you...\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Hello? Can you hear me? Hello? Can you hear me?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Yes I can hear you just fine. This is Morgan the AI receptionist for First Property Investment. How can I help you today?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Hey. Yeah, I, um, got this information off of a friend of mine and just wondering how you can help me. Um, I'm, may need to sell my house in the next six months.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Got it. We buy houses for cash as is with no obligation, and we can work on a timeline that fits your needs, usually around thirty to forty five days but we can adjust if you need longer. Would you like me to have Alex give you a call to discuss your situation?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Um, yeah, that's fine.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Okay,...\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"What information do you need from me?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Sure. First, could you tell me your first name?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Dave Lister, L-I-S-T-E-R.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Got it, Dave. Next, what's the best mobile number for Alex to reach you on? Please say it slowly so I get all ten digits right.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"424-279-0225.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Let me read that back to make sure I have it right. Is your number four two four two seven nine zero two two five? If yes, do you also want to share the property address or should we skip that for now?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Uh, the number is 424-279-0225.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Got it, Dave. Your number is four two four two seven nine zero two two five. Would you like to share the property address or should we skip that for...\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"I'm confused why you're telling me four two four two. That's not how numbers are arranged. They go by three, three, and four.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Sorry about that Dave I was just trying to be extra clear. Your number is four two four two seven nine zero two two five. Does that sound right? If yes would you like...\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"No, it keeps saying four two four two and it's confusing me.\"}]}",
        "system__user_id": "1457aa6d86d8b7d0ccc64d425680d7f6",
